#38700
Shadow Dancer Guild~
This is the new Shadow Dancers guild, built by Synister in the spring of 2003.
Opened 3-28-03.


The layout is as follows...
Main floor 
 __ __|__ __
      |\
      |

Lower Floor
|__\__
|

Arena
 __ __ _
|__|__|
|__|__|_

GM is east on main floor.  Guild board is N on main floor.
Challenge board is east on lower floor.  Arena is west on lower floor.

~
