#38701
Into The Shadows~
  As you enter this small chamber, you are chilled by the eerie
darkness. In the center of this room, a small flame flickers about,
illuminating a stone floor covered with a thin layer of dust. This
house of the devoid serves as a haunting contradiction to itself.
  There appears to be no circulation of air, however the flame dances
around the room, its movement propelled by something. The
silence is deafening, except for the occasional whisper of something
oddly familiar. The darkness of the room is blinding, yet strange
shadows dance across the stone walls. Footprints appear before your
eyes, where there was no foot to cause the impression. Maybe you do
not belong here... Maybe you should leave before the next thing you
hear is your own death...
~
