#38702
The Gathering Place~
  As you step out of the flames, you find yourself in a strange,
unexplainable realm, struck with the sensation of being surrounded
by nothing and everything at the same time. In the distance, you see
the bustling traffic of Samsera, yet there are no sounds accompanying
your vision. As you approach the sights of town, your progress is
halted by a cold, smooth surface. Feeling your way around, you realize
you are in the center of a large glass chamber in the Shadow Dancer's
Guild.
~
