#38703
The Hall of Mirrors~
  You have entered the small tunnel that leads to the Shadow Dancer's
Guild Board. Shadow Dancers skilled in the art of hiding their presence
will be able to pass through these mirrors without leaving behind
any evidence of their passage. If you watch the mirrors, you may see
images, shadows and even the warm breath of one who has not yet
mastered his skills.
~
