#38704
The Hall of Fire~
  You have entered the small tunnel that leads to the Shadow Dancer's
Hall of Knowledge. This tunnel is used as another training exercise
for all Shadow Dancers, testing their ability to move undetected. If you
look at the wall of flames surrounding you, you should only notice
small disturbances in the flames where other Shadow Dancers pass
through.
~
