#38705
The Hall of Silence~
  You have entered the small tunnel that leads to the Shadow Dancer's
Chamber of Meditiation. It is through this tunnel that Shadow Dancers
practice their art of silence, so as not to disturb their comrades.
The silence that fills this corridor is an eerie reminder of the power
of this class.
~
