#38706
A bad place to be standing...~
   At the western end of the room you can see shadows moving about the wall.  
Looking around the room, you notice there's nobody here, other than yourself,
to cast a shadow.  Normally, one would stand there somewhat confused at this
spectacle, however, a dirk whizzing by your ear brings you back to reality.  
Maybe you should move to safer ground.    
~
