#38708
The Hall of Knowledge~
   The walls of the hall are draped in tapestries depicting the endevours of
the first Shadow Dancer.  Rows of bookcases reach from one end of the hall to
the other, filled with tomes delving into both the dark arts and the slight of
hand.  Pull up a chair and stay a while, here is where you'll learn the secrets
the shadows conceal.    
~
