#38709
The Chamber of Meditation~
   The dark, velvety furnishings of this room are inviting.  The rug covering
the stone floor contains erratic, dark crimson and jade paths, leading
towards the center of the room.  At the center of the chamber, you find a
monument to the Shadow Dancer they call "the first".    
~
