#38712
The Challenge~
  Nestled deep inside these caves, a small room carved out of the
earth hides from normal mortal eyes. It is here where the Raven
Shadow Dancers come to petition a challenge for the rank of
Grandmaster. The Grandmaster is a rank of high standing within this
guild and is attained only through patience, cunning, stealth and
knowledge.
~
