#38713
The Grandmaster Battle Arena~
  You are standing on the outskirts of the Shadow Dancer's Arena,
where the current Shadow Dancer Grandmaster must defend his title
and challengers who meet the criteria come to steal it away. 
  To the South is the entrance for the Grandmaster, to the North is
the Challenger's entrance.
